## Restaurant Order System

### Menu Items and Categories

```xiom
enum Category {
  Appetizer;
  Main;
  Dessert;
  Drink;
}

type MenuItem {
  name: Str;
  price: Int;
  category: Category;
}

fn create_menu() -> Vec[MenuItem] {
  let mut menu: Vec[MenuItem] = Vec[MenuItem].new();
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Bruschetta", price: 850, category: Category.Appetizer });
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Caesar Salad", price: 950, category: Category.Appetizer });
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Grilled Salmon", price: 1895, category: Category.Main });
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Ribeye Steak", price: 2495, category: Category.Main });
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Tiramisu", price: 895, category: Category.Dessert });
  menu.push(MenuItem{ name: "Sparkling Water", price: 350, category: Category.Drink });
  menu
}
```

### Order and Cart

```xiom
type OrderItem {
  item: MenuItem;
  quantity: Int;
}

type Order {
  items: Vec[OrderItem];
  subtotal: Int;
  discount: Int;
  tax: Int;
  total: Int;
}
```

### Adding Items to Cart

```xiom
fn add_to_order(order: &mut Order, item: MenuItem, qty: Int) {
  order.items.push(OrderItem{ item: item, quantity: qty });
}

fn calculate_subtotal(order: &Order) -> Int {
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < order.items.len() {
    let oi = order.items.get(i).unwrap();
    total += oi.item.price * oi.quantity;
    i += 1;
  };
  total
}
```

### Discount Logic (with Contracts)

```xiom
requires { subtotal >= 0; }
ensures { result <= subtotal; }
fn calculate_discount(subtotal: Int) -> Int {
  if subtotal >= 5000 {
    return subtotal * 10 / 100;
  };
  0
}
```

### Finalizing the Order

```xiom
fn finalize_order(order: &mut Order) {
  order.subtotal = calculate_subtotal(order);
  order.discount = calculate_discount(order.subtotal);
  order.tax = (order.subtotal - order.discount) * 8 / 100;
  order.total = order.subtotal - order.discount + order.tax;
}
```

### Printing the Receipt

```xiom
fn format_price(cents: Int) -> Str {
  let dollars = cents / 100;
  let pen = cents % 100;
  io.println(dollars);
  io.println(pen);
  ""
}

fn print_receipt(order: &Order) {
  io.println("RECEIPT");
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < order.items.len() {
    let oi = order.items.get(i).unwrap();
    io.println(oi.item.name);
    io.println(oi.quantity);
    format_price(oi.item.price);
    i += 1;
  };
  io.println(order.subtotal);
  io.println(order.discount);
  io.println(order.total);
}
```

